  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CNFL Smart Street Lighting, through Tuatara Group, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant for the CNFL Smart Street Lighting Feasibility Study will support the deployment of energy-efficient street lights in San Jose, Costa Rica by the Compania Nacional de Fuerza y Luz, S.A. (CNFL). The grant will assist CNFL to install networked light emitting diode (LED) street lights on urban highways and roads to improve the quality and reliability of public lighting while at the same time reducing operating and maintenance costs. This project support the goals of the Clean Energy Finance Facility for the Caribbean and Central America (CEFF-CCA).</narrative>
  </description>
